QUERY NAME: qryFPSFigures_Sub
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year, Sum(MY_TimeCostCalcs.Pay) AS Pay, Sum((([NonPay]+[overhead]))) AS NonPayOH
FROM MY_TimeCostCalcs
WHERE (((MY_TimeCostCalcs.Month)<=fnMonthToFMonth([Forms]![frmMenuReports]![cbMonth]) Or (MY_TimeCostCalcs.Month) Is Null))
GROUP BY MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year
HAVING (((MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year)=fnReportYear()))
ORDER BY MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year;

